# <type>(<scope>): <subject>        ← ≤72 chars, imperative mood, no trailing period
#
# <body>                            ← what & why (not how); wrap at ~72. Blank line above.
#
# <footer>                          ← BREAKING CHANGE: <desc>   |   Refs #123 / Closes #123
#
# ── Conventional Commits (enforced by commitlint via the commit-msg hook) ──
# type   feat  fix  docs  style  refactor  perf  test  build  ci  chore  revert
# bump   feat → minor (0.x: patch)   fix/perf → patch   feat! / BREAKING CHANGE: → major (0.x: minor)
# scope  api worker web  engine db contracts domain infra adapters llm-protocol payments dify sdk  (optional)
#
# NOTE: on squash-merge the PR TITLE becomes the commit on main and the CHANGELOG
# entry — make the PR title a valid Conventional Commit too (CI checks it).
